~ start
Blacksmith: Welcome adventurer!
Blacksmith: I have what you need if you have enough gold.
Blacksmith: Do you want to see my goods?

- Yes => open_shop
- No => leave


~ open_shop
do GameState.choice = "yes"
Blacksmith: Very well, look what I have to sell!
=> END


~ leave
do GameState.choice = "no"
Blacksmith: Too bad... come back when you’re ready.
=> END